{"id":1755148,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-24T11:49:49.845Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":18,"name":"Drama"},{"id":35,"name":"Comedy"}],"homepage":"","id":1755148,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["CN"],"original_language":"zh","original_title":"不被凍住活那天的海","overview":"Seventeen-year-old Xiaokui has spent her entire life in a small seaside town. A top student with a quiet passion for girl idol groups, she is well known throughout the neighborhood — as is her closest friend, Qiangwei, a brilliant math prodigy who recently transferred back from the city.  At seventeen, Xiaokui’s world is one without romance, without a cellphone — just geography magazines and a giant television screen. In the stillness of her routine life, an unexpected “aurora” quietly descends upon this small town. Familiar faces. A familiar life. An endless sea, and a future that felt predictable at a glance — could life’s answers really be found through the endless pages of practice tests? The girls had so many questions. That summer, sitting on a weathered fishing boat, they imagined that if they could fix it, perhaps they could finally leave this place.","popularity":0.0071,"poster_path":"/kbQfa4X5TRgUgR1YZm8JGOdcWpy.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2026-08-21","revenue":0,"runtime":29,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"Mandarin","iso_639_1":"zh","name":"普通话"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Hiding in The Bubble","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[{"iso_3166_1":"CN","title":"The Sea That Survived The Day It Wasn't Frozen","type":"English direct translation"}]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":3922347,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Menqi He","original_name":"Menqi He","popularity":0.1794,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":1,"character":"Xiao Kui","credit_id":"6a8b8a9fa1d737e44ea84d41","order":0},{"adu